{"about_the_game":"Jasper's Island is a 2D-platformer where you play as a cat and lighthouse keeper. Both have different abilities to negotiate obstacles encountered when exploring the island's caves, forests and shipwrecks.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074840/extras/b27ae8959ebdb0c213e5d3bbfb302f18.poster.avif?t=1761533959\" width=600 height=125 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074840/extras/b27ae8959ebdb0c213e5d3bbfb302f18.webm?t=1761533959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>This hand drawn island is full of secrets and the story is told though symbols that can be enjoyed by anyone. You'll water the garden, repair the lighthouse, and investigate the mysterious spores.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074840/extras/93625096771f986adb67771d97aacc97.poster.avif?t=1761533959\" width=600 height=125 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074840/extras/93625096771f986adb67771d97aacc97.webm?t=1761533959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Beautiful painted environments with hand crafted lighting from morning to night</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Creatures and characters animated with traditional frame-by-frame drawings</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore the mysterious island at your own pace</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Collect all the secrets through multiple playthroughs</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A short game (about 2-3 hours) involving light puzzles and platforming elements</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>No AI tools or AI-generated art used in the production</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074840/extras/5cae7f09e02b55360465faaed35030c1.poster.avif?t=1761533959\" width=600 height=125 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074840/extras/5cae7f09e02b55360465faaed35030c1.webm?t=1761533959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2074840?t=1761533959","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074840/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761533959","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074840/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761533959","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074840/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761533959","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"Jasper's Island is a 2D-platformer where you play as a cat and lighthouse keeper. Both have different abilities to negotiate obstacles encountered when exploring the island's caves, forests and shipwrecks.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074840/extras/b27ae8959ebdb0c213e5d3bbfb302f18.poster.avif?t=1761533959\" width=600 height